### 1. Cadastrar Funcionario sem campos (Deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste"
}

### 2. Cadastrar Funcionario 1 - Carlos (Publico)
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva",
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 3. Cadastrar Funcionario 2 - Maria (Publico)
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Maria Souza",
    "email": "maria@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 4. Login com senha incorreta (Deve retornar 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "999"
}

### 5. Login com e-mail inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "naoexiste@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 6. Login com Carlos (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 7. Rota protegida sem token (Deve retornar erro 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas

### 8. Rota protegida com token invalido (Deve retornar erro 401/500)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: token-invalido

### 9. Cadastrar Motorista 1 - Roberto
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Roberto Lima",
    "cnh": "04512398760",
    "cpf": "11122233396",
    "telefone": "48999991111"
}

