### 25. Cadastrar Entrega 1 (Data: 25/10/2026 - Carga 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Florianopolis",
    "destino": "Rua das Flores, 123",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

