### 30. Atualizar Entrega 1 (Status para ENTREGUE e data para 30/10/2026)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

